75a1b28de8caddb6d30b2e3d72ef3dec09450b47 and additional OMP compatibility
changes for sessions, goals, approvals, monitors, runtime adapters,
configuration, packaging and documentation.
This copy also integrates upstream 49fba4dc081c9238f01e617b2fd17f548438e624,
preserving those local adaptations and the separately pinned omp-ulw source.

